          {
            "finding": "compression 1.8.2, mounted on connect 3.7.0 the way @react-native-community/cli-server-api build/index.js line 57 mounts it, served a gzip body that decoded to the original JSON. The server kept listening after a client aborted a response.",
            "cites": "Steps 3",
            "none": "The development server works on compression 1.8.2."
